{"candidates":[{"content":"Extend the grounded extension to a two-dimensional label: each node receives (status, rank), where status is accepted/refuted/suspended and rank is an ordinal from the longest chain of defeating warrants that the skeptical fixpoint traverses. Acceptance then requires both status and a rank bound preserved under reinstatement; refutation carries the rank of the attacking root. This preserves determinism and polynomial cost if ranks are capped by graph size, but the rank component may not be monotone, so the least fixed point must be computed as a lexicographic product and rank-tie breaking must be canonical or confluence can fail.","evidence_refs":[],"refs":[{"role":"dependence","target":"6ff890a4d3eb1d73b7d5ed91996a87bdbb4be77780452b71692716cbaf1dbfb3"},{"role":"dependence","target":"ab957e876404fc088730d65b144983031950d2a2b2a66e6e81448f0a045d911c"},{"role":"dependence","target":"f03ef50f69a6f01ee1dbc271065b54b0b320913a46b9f3d49c0c874b46ae2348"}],"typicality":0.45},{"content":"Replace the skeptical fixed-point label function with a dialectical game: Proponent claims a node, Opponent attacks with warrant-carriages, Proponent replies with an accepted counterattack; acceptance is existence of a winning strategy in a finite game. The grounded extension is then the set of nodes with a winning strategy that does not depend on order of play. Reinstatement becomes a game-theoretic derived property and the strategy tree is a natural certificate, but the game is only polynomial if restricted to DAG attacks or bounded repetition; otherwise PSPACE-hardness threatens.","evidence_refs":[],"refs":[{"role":"dependence","target":"6ff890a4d3eb1d73b7d5ed91996a87bdbb4be77780452b71692716cbaf1dbfb3"},{"role":"dependence","target":"ab957e876404fc088730d65b144983031950d2a2b2a66e6e81448f0a045d911c"},{"role":"dependence","target":"adb2479eafb0474ad7b3164ad74923dfc256931fbff960d03837d139615e2b79"}],"typicality":0.35},{"content":"Make the skeptical fixpoint incremental over warrant addition by maintaining a persistent union-find over defeat-equivalence classes and a versioned label array; when a new attack edge is materialized, only the strongly connected component of the changed edge is recomputed using a dynamic algorithm for the grounded extension of that component. This preserves the exact fixed point and polynomial amortized cost under bounded edits, but requires decomposability into components with no cross-component reinstatement; otherwise local recomputation can miss global reinstatement and needs a fixpoint over components.","evidence_refs":[],"refs":[{"role":"dependence","target":"f03ef50f69a6f01ee1dbc271065b54b0b320913a46b9f3d49c0c874b46ae2348"}],"typicality":0.5},{"content":"Parameterize the grounded extension by a school policy that selects which warrant-carriages count as attack edges, and make the skeptical fixpoint return not a single extension but a compact representation of the family of extensions as the policy ranges over a finite policy lattice. Determinism is preserved per policy, the policy-dependent function becomes auditable, and cost stays polynomial if the lattice has bounded width. Criticizable because the family may not be monotone in the policy order, so the compact representation may degrade to a full truth table.","evidence_refs":[],"refs":[{"role":"dependence","target":"8929789f0ae19d5b1c2537f758719daf17f9908ce1fb0ca3fa0cc60fe9f2a2a3"},{"role":"dependence","target":"6ff890a4d3eb1d73b7d5ed91996a87bdbb4be77780452b71692716cbaf1dbfb3"},{"role":"dependence","target":"b6d7ac7f6cd8ea654619d86890ee624c6ee9bd8ab490e3dff378ce0be0ed8a3a"}],"typicality":0.55},{"content":"Add a residue operator on the fixed point: for each suspended node, compute the set of accepted attackers and the set of accepted defenders; define a secondary extension that accepts exactly those suspended nodes whose attacker set is empty and defender set is nonempty, but do not commit this secondary extension to the root-validity guarantee. Emit it as a distinct probationary label so downstream reasoners can use it heuristically without treating it as grounded. This strengthens usable output without weakening the committed fixed point, but risks label confusion unless the marker is type-enforced.","evidence_refs":[],"refs":[{"role":"dependence","target":"21256139649bab4a7a030acd3ff6c058c808cbe4b0770cb1c72e3b4924836a64"},{"role":"dependence","target":"80255a44b79e939bc4dda1d5411951617558a5952379fbc9dd437c2a31e981b8"}],"typicality":0.4},{"content":"Change the skeptical semantics from a least fixed point of a monotone operator to the unique model of a nonmonotone logic program with explicit defeat rules, and prove that this model coincides with the grounded extension on acyclic attack graphs but differs on cycles by treating odd-length cycles as refuting all members and even-length cycles as suspending all. This makes odd cycles refuted rather than suspended, retaining determinism and polynomial cost via stratification, but it abandons standard reinstatement on cyclic graphs, so it is a deliberate trade-off.","evidence_refs":[],"refs":[{"role":"dependence","target":"6ff890a4d3eb1d73b7d5ed91996a87bdbb4be77780452b71692716cbaf1dbfb3"},{"role":"dependence","target":"adb2479eafb0474ad7b3164ad74923dfc256931fbff960d03837d139615e2b79"}],"typicality":0.25}],"simulation_proposals":[]}